## 8. Challenges and Limitations

One challenge is preventing vendor costs from being counted twice when users record deposits or payments. To address this, the new system allows expenses to be linked directly to vendors.

Expenses created in earlier versions are not automatically linked to vendors, so users must update those records manually by deleting and recreating them if necessary.

Another limitation is that reminders only appear when users open or refresh Planora. The prototype does not currently send external notifications.

